    "title": "Players make all-district, all-state rosters - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By TCNS staff ,\n11 hours ago After stellar seasons on the gridiron, numerous Trinity County players were tabbed for honors. For the Indians, Blake Chaney was named Newcomer of the Year. Trystin Ard, Haygen Townsend, Gunner Wilson and Gabe Constante were selected for the first team, while Colton Cox, Jay Smith, Wilson, Cuyler Parker and Connor Cathey were selected for the second team. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
